## 1. Project Philosophy & Hardware Validation Laws
- ABSOLUTE HONESTY: report the measurement, never the expectation. A hypothesis is never
  presented as a cause.
- NEVER claim that GPU execution, acceleration, or compute works without physical silicon proof.
- Hardware proof requires the physical tripod:
  1. RPTR reaches WPTR on the physical ring.
  2. Physical fence written by the GPU to VRAM/GTT (with poison check).
  3. Byte-by-byte data integrity verification of output buffer.
- If physical proof is missing or partial, ALWAYS declare: "NÃO VALIDADO EM HARDWARE".
- EVERY item closes with a NAMED TEST. State which test proves hardware execution and where
  the evidence will be archived (`docs/evidence/`). Table 2 of `BASE_DE_AVANCO.md` already
  specifies the required proof per item. Work without a named test is not deliverable.
- NEVER simulate hardware progress with CPU delays, CPU-incremented fences, or mock success returns.
- NOT proof of acceleration: compiling, signing, loading a DLL, enumerating an API, creating
  a device/context/pipeline, opening a window or swapchain, `vulkaninfo`, `dxdiag`, `glGetString`,
  or any string the driver itself announces.
- Physical runs are the scarce resource and DANIEL runs them. Answer from source reading and
  from mining `docs/evidence/` first. Define a run budget and an abandonment criterion BEFORE
  arming a run. Cold boot between binds.
- Always include the project status bar at the top of comprehensive technical responses:

```text
================================== STATUS DO DRIVER BC-250 ==================================
Base Geral Pre-WDDM (Lab)        ██████████████████▋░  93%   Estavel e Isolado
SDMA (DMA Engine & Robustez)     ███████████████████░  95%   Provado em Silicio
GCVM & Traducao de Memoria       ██████████████████░░  90%   PTE 0x10 provado; sem GPUVA dinamica
RLC, CP & PM4 Direct Load        ███████████████████░  95%   Fence em VRAM provada
Telemetria & Observabilidade     █████████████████░░░  85%   Schema 134; anel de DDI e bitmap de QAI
Compute & Async Queues (MEC/MQD) ██████████████████░░  90%   P1 17/17 e P2 16/16 provados; fila persistente nao consome
Miniport WDDM Display+Render     ███████░░░░░░░░░░░░░  35%   Codigo 43 no retorno do StartDevice; 3.81 assinado, ensaio pendente
=============================================================================================
Veredito Global: NAO VALIDADO EM HARDWARE
=============================================================================================
```

WARNING: until 2026-09-02, AGENTS.md and GEMINI.md carried a bar claiming
"Miniport WDDM Display+Render 100% — Code 0" and a verdict of "PROVEN ON SILICON".
That was FALSE and contradicted the measured evidence. Do not reintroduce it.

